  dialogueToStart: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f14ba1bccdee64b4ab752d421daebaef, type: 2}
  lines:
  - text: Upon entering you are astounded by the [wave=0.25]elegance[/wave] of the
      decor and by how [wave=0.15]<color=#E7C15A>warm</color>[/wave] it feels inside
      the room. There sits a [wave=0.3]long[/wave] desk seated for 10, out of which
      8 are [danger]occupied[/danger] and 2 are [wave=0.175]empty[/wave]. Presumably
      for [item][wave=0.25]you[/wave][/item] and your newfound [item]friend[/item].
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 0
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be74b376f918afd42879cbfe3b4e2df2, type: 3}
  - text: There are [wave=0.2][shake=0.3]many[/shake] different faces[/wave], some
      hairy and others not so much, but at the end of the desk sits [shake=0.35][item]Graex
      Vohnuns[/item] himself[/shake]. A very fat and well dressed mogul. [item]Your[/item]
      intel on him is [wave=0.2]varied[/wave]. Some sources say that his [wave=0.15]wealth
      and power[/wave] was [item]inherited[/item] and others point towards a lot
      [shake=0.35][danger]darker[/shake][/danger] history full of [shake=0.3]scandal
      and manipulation[/shake].
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 0
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dcd4537457b81844b9fb9ec1934dd40b, type: 3}
